      "clip": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-global-manual-ai/10717553-fbf6-591d-840c-948130683a36/scratchpad/media/MECH-056.mp4",
      "phrase": "Because the weight is not landing on that band any more.",
      "key": "weight",
      "layout": {
